{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>人工智能晶片龍頭Nvidia（英偉達）周三（18日）召開員工大會，臨時行政總裁克雷斯在逾30名董事會成員及高層簇擁下發言，表示公司最新一季的業績理想，她對原行政總裁黃仁勳離職後的公司前景有信心。另外，消息人士透露，Nvidia委託的獵頭公司已接觸晶片技術公司Arm行政總裁哈斯（Rene Haas）。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:23:57.768154+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:44:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:17:31.337120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:33.384648+00:00","content_hash":"0cc9a254dd3749c0db503b6d6e013ccac7f8a2a8e476f89c807a3b961af3f573","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}